## Teams

National-team identities, federation and men’s/women’s team flags. Preserve historical team identities.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|------|--------------|------|-------------|--------------|
| key_id | Row Key | integer | Source row key; not a person, team or tournament identity. | key_id |
| team_id | Team ID | string | Stable team identifier; join using this value. | team_id |
| team_name | Team Name | string | Recorded team name. | team_name |
| team_code | Team Code | string | Recorded team code. | team_code |
| mens_team | Men’s Team | integer | 1 for a men’s national team, otherwise 0. | mens_team |
| womens_team | Women’s Team | integer | 1 for a women’s national team, otherwise 0. | womens_team |
| federation_name | Federation Name | string | Name of the national football federation. | federation_name |
| region_name | Region Name | string | Geographic region of the confederation. | region_name |
| confederation_id | Confederation ID | string | Stable confederation identifier; join using this value. | confederation_id |
| confederation_name | Confederation Name | string | Recorded confederation name. | confederation_name |
| confederation_code | Confederation Code | string | Recorded confederation code. | confederation_code |
| mens_team_wikipedia_link | Mens Team Wikipedia Link | string | Wikipedia reference for mens team. | mens_team_wikipedia_link |
| womens_team_wikipedia_link | Womens Team Wikipedia Link | string | Wikipedia reference for womens team. | womens_team_wikipedia_link |
| federation_wikipedia_link | Federation Wikipedia Link | string | Wikipedia reference for federation. | federation_wikipedia_link |

